{"id":"fe827319be301398","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-normalization-confluence.md","title":"Newman Lemma","display":"thm-normalization-confluence — Newman Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-normalization-confluence","aliases":["72-thm-normalization-confluence"],"display":"thm-normalization-confluence — Newman Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-strong-normalization]]","[[72-df-confluence]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Newman, On Theories with a Combinatorial Definition of Equivalence, Annals of Mathematics 43 (1942), 223–243; local well-founded induction argument recorded","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-normalization-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-normalization-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-normalization-confluence — Newman Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cb1e684c866136a\" href=\"?note=9cb1e684c866136a\" title=\"72-df-strong-normalization\">72-df-strong-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f91888dacef2bdf\" href=\"?note=9f91888dacef2bdf\" title=\"72-df-confluence\">72-df-confluence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Newman, On Theories with a Combinatorial Definition of Equivalence, Annals of Mathematics 43 (1942), 223–243; local well-founded induction argument recorded"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; full proof not reproduced or machine verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X^2\">\\(R\\subseteq X^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)\\)</span> 分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cb1e684c866136a\" href=\"?note=9cb1e684c866136a\" title=\"72-df-strong-normalization\">72-df-strong-normalization</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f91888dacef2bdf\" href=\"?note=9f91888dacef2bdf\" title=\"72-df-confluence\">72-df-confluence</a> 的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\land\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Conf}(X,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\land\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Conf}(X,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对起点按逆归约良基归纳，一步局部分叉先汇合，较小起点上的归纳假设再连接任意有限分叉。不能删去局部合流：三点系统a→b、a→c终止但不合流。此为Newman引理，标题中的旧“normalization implies confluence”缺少必要条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-strong-normalization","status":"resolved","id":"9cb1e684c866136a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-strong-normalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"9f91888dacef2bdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-confluence]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-strong-normalization","status":"resolved","id":"9cb1e684c866136a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$。$\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)$ 分别使用 [[72-df-strong-normalization]] 与 [[72-df-confluence]] 的定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"9f91888dacef2bdf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$。$\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)$ 分别使用 [[72-df-strong-normalization]] 与 [[72-df-confluence]] 的定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)\\land\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{Conf}(X,R).","display":true}],"bytes":1503,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-normalization-confluence|thm-normalization-confluence — Newman Lemma]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-normalization-confluence|thm-normalization-confluence — Newman Lemma]]"}],"outgoing":["9cb1e684c866136a","9f91888dacef2bdf"]}